msgid "Keng Tung. Text briefing. Freeze the GTFC tank column, then destroy it. Infantry screens the tanks. Toxic Defoliation can freeze them. Casting it does not end the mission. A spray run comes down the road and has to be cut off. If it lands, it defoliates your line and the side cache is lost."
